{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_190","slug":"fr2023-190-flo","title":{"native":"Flo","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-11-01","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Géraldine Danon","slug":"geraldine-danon","name":"Géraldine Danon","birthYear":1968,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Biopic"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/39/10/264743/format_page/flo.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eWlH33wwY4c"},"synopsis":{"native":"Connue comme \"la petite fiancée de l’Atlantique\", Florence Arthaud fut surtout une grande navigatrice. Son palmarès exceptionnel, et unique dans cet univers masculin, connut son apogée avec sa victoire de la Route du Rhum en 1990. Au-delà de ces exploits, Flo raconte l’incroyable destin d’une femme farouchement libre qui décide de rejeter son milieu bourgeois et la vie qui lui avait été tracée, pour vivre pleinement ses rêves.","english":"Known as \"the little fiancée of the Atlantic\", Florence Arthaud was above all a great sailor. Her exceptional list of achievements, unique in this male-dominated world, culminated in her victory in the Route du Rhum in 1990. Beyond these exploits, Flo recounts the incredible destiny of a fiercely free woman who decided to reject her bourgeois milieu and the life that had been laid out for her, to live her dreams to the full."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Charles Berling","slug":"charles-berling","name":"Charles Berling","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Gustave Parking","slug":"gustave-parking","name":"Gustave Parking","birthYear":1955,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Géraldine Danon","slug